liffe Wakholi presided over the ground-breaking ceremony at the Endebess AHP site, signalling the formal commencement of Phase 2 construction works.</p>\\r\\n              <a href=\\\"news-article.php\\\" class=\\\"rel-card-link\\\">Read Article <i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-arrow-right\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></i></a>\\r\\n            </div>\\r\\n          </article>\\r\\n\\r\\n          <!-- Related Card 2 -->\\r\\n          <article class=\\\"rel-card\\\">\\r\\n            <div class=\\\"rel-card-img\\\" style=\\\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0d0918,#150d2c)\\\">\\r\\n              <div class=\\\"rel-card-img-ph\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-file-contract\\\"></i></div>\\r\\n              <img src=\\\"uploads/news/policy-affordable-housing.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"CS Hinga at AHP policy briefing\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" onerror=\\\"this.style.display=\'none\'\\\">\\r\\n              <span class=\\\"news-cat-badge news-cat--policy\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute;\\\">Policy</span>\\r\\n            </div>\\r\\n            <div class=\\\"rel-card-body\\\">\\r\\n              <div class=\\\"rel-card-meta\\\">\\r\\n                <time class=\\\"rel-card-date\\\" datetime=\\\"2026-05-08\\\">\\r\\n                  <i class=\\\"fa-regular fa-calendar\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></i> 8 May 2026\\r\\n                </time>\\r\\n                <span class=\\\"rel-card-date\\\"><i class=\\\"fa-regular fa-clock\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></i> 5 min</span>\\r\\n              </div>\\r\\n              <h3 class=\\\"rel-card-title\\\">CS Hinga Announces KSh 450M Additional Allocation for Trans-Nzoia AHP</h3>\\r\\n              <p class=\\\"rel-card-excerpt\\\">Speaking at the National Housing Summit in Nairobi, CS Hinga confirmed a supplementary budget allocation of KSh 450 million for Trans-Nzoia County.</p>\\r\\n              <a href=\\\"news-article.php\\\" class=\\\"rel-card-link\\\">Read Article <i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-arrow-right\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></i></a>\\r\\n            </div>\\r\\n          </article>\\r\\n\\r\\n          <!-- Related Card 3 -->\\r\\n          <article class=\\\"rel-card\\\">\\r\\n            <div class=\\\"rel-card-img\\\" style=\\\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#001812,#002b20)\\\">\\r\\n              <div class=\\\"rel-card-img-ph\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-people-group\\\"></i></div>\\r\\n              <img src=\\\"uploads/news/community-engagement.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Community beneficiary registration session\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" onerror=\\\"this.style.display=\'none\'\\\">\\r\\n              <span class=\\\"news-cat-badge news-cat--community\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute;\\\">Community</span>\\r\\n            </div>\\r\\n            <div class=\\\"rel-card-body\\\">\\r\\n              <div class=\\\"rel-card-meta\\\">\\r\\n                <time class=\\\"rel-card-date\\\" datetime=\\\"2026-04-28\\\">\\r\\n                  <i class=\\\"fa-regular fa-calendar\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></i> 28 Apr 2026\\r\\n                </time>\\r\\n                <span class=\\\"rel-card-date\\\"><i class=\\\"fa-regular fa-clock\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></i> 3 min</span>\\r\\n              </div>\\r\\n              <h3 class=\\\"rel-card-title\\\">Saboti Constituency Beneficiary Registration Opens â€” Over 1,200 Apply in First Week</h3>\\r\\n              <p class=\\\"rel-card-excerpt\\\">The beneficiary registration exercise for Saboti Constituency&rsquo;s 180-unit AHP allocation drew overwhelming interest, with more than 1,200 applications submitted in the opening week.</p>\\r\\n              <a href=\\\"news-article.php\\\" class=\\\"rel-card-link\\\">Read Article <i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-arrow-right\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></i></a>\\r\\n            </div>\\r\\n          </article>\\r\\n\\r\\n        </div><!-- /article-related-grid -->\\r\\n      </div><!-- /container -->\\r\\n    </section>\\r\\n\\r\\n    <!-- ===== VERTICAL SHARE 